From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] protoc-gen-connect-python: build a linux/riscv64 wheel

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not submitted yet: v0.9.0-connect-python is the last release under this name (renamed to protoc-gen-connectrpc in v0.9.0); the same two-line change applies to protoc-gen-connectrpc on main]

The plugin is a pure-Go binary built with CGO_ENABLED=0, so linux/riscv64
only needs adding to goreleaser's targets. generate_wheels.py then needs a
platform tag for it, otherwise it raises "Unsupported platform:
linux/riscv64". The binary is static, so it gets the same manylinux +
musllinux pair as amd64/arm64, with manylinux_2_31 as the riscv64 floor
(uv recognises no older riscv64 manylinux tag).

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 protoc-gen-connect-python/.goreleaser.yaml           | 1 +
 protoc-gen-connect-python/scripts/generate_wheels.py | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/protoc-gen-connect-python/.goreleaser.yaml b/protoc-gen-connect-python/.goreleaser.yaml
index 712f7b0..42a9889 100644
--- a/protoc-gen-connect-python/.goreleaser.yaml
+++ b/protoc-gen-connect-python/.goreleaser.yaml
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@ builds:
     targets:
       - linux_amd64
       - linux_arm64
+      - linux_riscv64
       - darwin_amd64
       - darwin_arm64
       - windows_amd64
diff --git a/protoc-gen-connect-python/scripts/generate_wheels.py b/protoc-gen-connect-python/scripts/generate_wheels.py
index 8076157..371c150 100644
--- a/protoc-gen-connect-python/scripts/generate_wheels.py
+++ b/protoc-gen-connect-python/scripts/generate_wheels.py
@@ -30,6 +30,8 @@ def main() -> None:
                         platform = "manylinux_2_17_x86_64.manylinux2014_x86_64.musllinux_1_1_x86_64"
                     case "arm64":
                         platform = "manylinux_2_17_aarch64.manylinux2014_aarch64.musllinux_1_1_aarch64"
+                    case "riscv64":
+                        platform = "manylinux_2_31_riscv64.musllinux_1_1_riscv64"
             case "windows":
                 match artifact["goarch"]:
                     case "amd64":
-- 
2.43.0

